#: main/src/ui/application.vala:1842
msgid ""
"This will delete cached files, avatars, previews and database caches (entity "
"discovery, roster, MAM sync state, stickers).\n"
"\n"
"All data will be re-fetched from the server when needed."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດແບບນີ້ຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ, ຮູບໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ແຄຊຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (entity discovery, "
"roster, MAM sync state, stickers).\n"
"\n"
"ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກເຊີເວີໃໝ່ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ."

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:1893
#, c-format
msgid "Cache cleared (%s freed, %d DB rows removed)"
msgstr "ລຶບແຄຊແລ້ວ (ຄືນພື້ນທີ່ %s, ລຶບແຖວຖານຂໍ້ມູນ %d ແຖວ)"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:1896
msgid "Failed to clear cache"
msgstr "ລຶບແຄຊຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:1943
msgid ""
"This will delete all messages, files and OMEMO encryption keys.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Your accounts will remain, but you will lose all chat history and need to "
"re-verify encryption with your contacts.</b>\n"
"\n"
"This action cannot be undone!"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດແບບນີ້ຈະລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຄີເຂົ້າລະຫັດ OMEMO ທັງໝົດ.\n"
"\n"
"<b>ບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານຈະຍັງຄືເກົ່າ, ແຕ່ທ່ານຈະສູນເສຍປະຫວັດການແຊັດທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຢືນຢັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດກັບຜູ້ຕິ"
"ດຕໍ່ຂອງທ່ານໃໝ່.</b>\n"
"\n"
"ການກະທຳນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໄດ້!"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:1973
msgid "Resetting database… DinoX will restart."
msgstr "ກຳລັງຣີເຊັດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ... DinoX ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່."

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:2043
msgid ""
"<b>⚠️ WARNING: This will delete ALL data!</b>\n"
"\n"
"• All accounts\n"
"• All messages and files\n"
"• All encryption keys\n"
"• All settings\n"
"\n"
"This is irreversible. Make sure to create a backup first!"
msgstr ""
"<b>⚠️ ຄຳເຕືອນ: ນີ້ຈະລຶບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ!</b>\n"
"\n"
"• ທຸກບັນຊີ\n"
"• ທຸກຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌\n"
"• ທຸກຄີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ\n"
"• ທຸກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"\n"
"ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເອົາຄືນໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ກ່ອນ!"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:2048
msgid "Create Backup First"
msgstr "ສ້າງການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນ"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:2049
msgid "Delete Everything"
msgstr "ລຶບທຸກຢ່າງ"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:2069
msgid "Are you absolutely sure?"
msgstr "ທ່ານແນ່ໃຈແທ້ໆຫຼືບໍ່?"

#: main/src/ui/application.vala:2070
msgid ""
"Type 'DELETE' to confirm factory reset.\n"
"\n"
