#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:903
msgid "MQTT"
msgstr "MQTT"

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1194
msgid ""
"ℹ Server: ejabberd (mod_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd shares XMPP and MQTT authentication.\n"
"You can use your XMPP credentials to connect\n"
"to the MQTT broker on the same domain.\n"
"\n"
"Per-account mode uses these credentials automatically."
msgstr ""
"ℹ ເຊີເວີ: ejabberd (ກວດພົບ mod_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"ejabberd ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ XMPP ແລະ MQTT ຮ່ວມກັນ.\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ XMPP ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ\n"
"ໂບຣກເກີ MQTT ໃນໂດເມນດຽວກັນໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ໂໝດແຍກຕາມບັນຊີຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: plugins/mqtt/src/plugin.vala:1202
msgid ""
"⚠ Server: Prosody (mod_pubsub_mqtt detected)\n"
"\n"
"Prosody's MQTT bridge does NOT support authentication.\n"
"Any client on the network can subscribe to topics.\n"
"\n"
"Recommendations:\n"
"• Restrict MQTT port via firewall\n"
"• Use TLS for encryption\n"
"• Do not publish sensitive data\n"
"\n"
"Topic format: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"
msgstr ""
"⚠ ເຊີເວີ: Prosody (ກວດພົບ mod_pubsub_mqtt)\n"
"\n"
"ຂົວ MQTT ຂອງ Prosody ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ.\n"
"ໃຜກໍຕາມໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍສາມາດຕິດຕາມຫົວຂໍ້ຕ່າງໆໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ຄຳແນະນຳ:\n"
"• ຈຳກັດພອດ MQTT ຜ່ານໄຟວໍ (firewall)\n"
"• ໃຊ້ TLS ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"• ຢ່າສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຫຼື ເປັນຄວາມລັບ\n"
"\n"
"ຮູບແບບຫົວຂໍ້: <HOST>/<TYPE>/<NODE>"

