msgstr "ປົກປິດຄວາມຈິງທີ່ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ Tor ຢູ່."

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:68
msgid "Firewall Mode (Port 80/443 Only)"
msgstr "ໂໝດໄຟວໍ (ສະເພາະພອດ 80/443)"

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:69
msgid ""
"Only connect to bridges using standard web ports. Helps behind strict "
"firewalls."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາຂົວທີ່ໃຊ້ພອດເວັບມາດຕະຖານເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ພາຍໃຕ້ໄຟວໍທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ."

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:76
msgid ""
"Warning: Only bridges on port 80/443 will work when Firewall Mode is enabled!"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳເຕືອນ: ເມື່ອເປີດໂໝດໄຟວໍ ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຂົວທີ່ຢູ່ໃນພອດ 80/443 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ!"

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:102
msgid "Bridge List (Auto or Manual Entry)"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຂົວ (ໃສ່ເອງ ຫຼື ອັດຕະໂນມັດ)"

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:133
msgid "Request Fresh Bridges"
msgstr "ຂໍລາຍຊື່ຂົວໃໝ່"

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:134
msgid "Fetches bridges from Tor Project. Choose transport type:"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຂົວຈາກ Tor Project. ເລືອກປະເພດການຮັບສົ່ງ:"

#: plugins/tor-manager/src/settings_page.vala:172
msgid ""
"WebTunnel (port 443, looks like HTTPS) is best for strict firewalls. obfs4 "
"is more widely available. Both fetch instantly without CAPTCHA."
msgstr ""
"WebTunnel (ພອດ 443, ເບິ່ງຄື HTTPS) ແມ່ນດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບໄຟວໍທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. obfs4 ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປກວ່າ. ທັງ"
"ສອງແບບສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ທັນທີໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ CAPTCHA."

